### 2.7 Tool Selection Hierarchy

Query Type → Tool Selection:
1. "Which files import X?" → ADG Redis: adg_edge_fanin(node, "imports")
2. "What does file X call?" → ADG Redis: adg_edge_fanout(node, "calls")
