Decision Matrix:
| Need | Tool | When |
|------|------|------|
| Relationship query | ADG Redis | Cache is hot (adg_status → fresh) |
| Relationship query | ADG SQLite | Cache stale, SQLite exists |
| Bulk symbol search | ADG SQLite | SQL query faster than Redis scan |
| Fresh-file structure | AST parse | File changed since last ADG regen |
| String literal/comment | grep/regex | ADG doesn't index these |
| File discovery | ADG nodes_by_file/layer | Replaces glob/rglob |
| Fallback | AST → grep | ADG unavailable AND fail-closed waived |

